flowchart LR
    R[Request ID and original text] --> C[Classification result<br/>category confidence explanation review flag metadata]
    C -->|structured classifier output| CC[Checker checks required fields]
    CC -->|accepted result| V[Validation result<br/>valid needs_review reason]
    CC -->|recoverable issue| CF[Checker feedback]
    CF -->|optional correction context| C
    V --> VC[Checker verifies allowlist and review invariants]
    VC -->|known validated intent| D[Routing decision<br/>workflow ID]
    VC -->|review decision| Q[Review queue state]
    D --> DC[Checker compares expected configured workflow]
    DC -->|canonical route| X[Execution result<br/>structured message]
    X --> XC[Checker verifies result contract]
    XC --> O[Final request status and result]
    Q --> H[Human action and feedback]
    H -->|approve known canonical route| X
    H -->|reject or clarify| O
    R -. context .-> CTX[(Shared orchestrator context)]
    C -. context .-> CTX
    V -. context .-> CTX
    D -. context .-> CTX
    X -. context .-> CTX
    C -. actual inputs outputs and timestamps .-> TRACE[(Persisted agent_executions)]
    V -. trace .-> TRACE
    D -. trace .-> TRACE
    X -. trace .-> TRACE
    CC -. checker result and feedback .-> TRACE
